早早在家等着，还打电话催了。来到柳宏斌家，门已经开着，林飞发现，门口除了老柳的出租车外，还停了一辆黑色的路虎揽胜，这两百多万的车，难道他女儿柳景岚开的？一进院子，就见到柳宏斌正在水龙头边杀着鲫鱼。“林飞你来啦，嘿嘿，你嫂子要做你喜欢的雪菜小鲫鱼，让我多杀几条”。柳宏斌以前当过兵，性子爽朗，四十多岁的人，身材依然很健硕，但一张瘦长的脸上满是岁月的沧桑，头发也有些白丝了。“不用这么多，差不多就行了，嫂子不刚出院么，不能让她太劳累”，林飞笑着道。“这哪成，我老柳最不喜欢欠别人，是朋友也不行，你这段时间帮着我大晚上代班，白天还去找工作，去工地干活，你当我不知道？好好犒劳你是应该的”，柳宏斌执拗道。林飞就喜欢这个老哥一副实诚肠子，老一辈吃过苦当过兵的，精神风貌都不太一样。“你快进去吧，景岚那丫头刚刚已经回来了，还带了一个他的同学，叫……叫什么来着，我忘了，嗨，反正你跟景岚多聊聊”，柳宏斌一副“是男人都懂”的表情，朝林飞眨了眨眼。林飞莞尔，看来这货是为女儿的婚嫁愁得头发花白了，真是恨不得立刻给女儿找个婆家。进到客厅，果然见到一男一女已经在那里看着电视，而大嫂于梅梅正拉着那女子的手，笑眯眯地说着什么，时不时还看一眼旁边的男子。“林飞你来啦？”身材有些发福，徐娘半老的于梅梅看见林飞，招呼着说：“来来，坐下，我给你倒点凉茶，给你认识认识，这就是我跟老柳常说的，咱女儿柳景岚，这个是她大学里读博士的学长，叫张澈。”林飞微笑着朝二人点点头，柳景岚淡淡地礼貌性笑了笑，而一旁的张澈上下打量了下林飞的衣着打扮，眼里露出一抹不屑与傲气，但也一闪即逝，反倒友好地站起来，跟林飞握手。“你好，我叫张澈，是景岚的学长”。他穿着件纪梵希印花白底短袖，头发整齐梳理，面孔白白净净，身材也足有一米八几，看着就像个富家公子哥的男模特般。“我叫林飞”，林飞知道这家伙看不起自己，但也无所谓，反正今天也是卖老柳夫妇的面子，来吃顿饭。柳景岚柔柔的声音开口道：“我听妈说，最近两三个月，你一直帮我爸代班开夜出租，帮我妈交了不少医药费，真的要谢谢你。”女人穿着一身宽松的白色直条纹衬衣，隐隐能看到里面傲人的弧线，以及一抹紫色的文胸，下面是一条浅咖啡色的包臀七分裤，紧致而修长的美腿显得很是纤柔。她肤色白皙，下巴尖尖的，瑶鼻精巧，戴着一副细黑框眼镜，漂亮的大眼睛可以看得出，眼镜的度数并不高，或者压根就是装饰品。一头乌黑的长发简单地垂在右肩一侧，浑身透着一股子书卷气质的文静，也有一丝丝清新的小妩媚。之前一直听老柳夸赞他女儿是大美人，林飞还不太相信，可今天看见，确实是个美人，还是那种，越看越耐看的。林飞摇摇头，“我也抽分成的，这比我去工地赚钱可要轻松不少。”“哦？小林还去工地干活？不知道会什么手艺？”张澈嘴角斜斜地问了句。林飞坦然地道：“比较多就抗包，搬运一些东西，偶尔有机会也当下水泥工。不过最近活难找，有点头疼。”“我跟景岚也常在工地干活，不过我们是在‘考古工地’，呵呵，跟小林你的活不太一样，我们是要求细致和专业，毕竟那些古董很多都价值连城”。张澈很是自然地喊着“小林”，俨然是不屑喊林飞的全名。于梅梅这时期待地问道：“张澈啊，以前景岚也不太跟咱说她在外面做什么，原来你们真是去挖古董啊？那些古董我听说上千万的都有啊！”“是的，伯母，其实这次我就跟景岚刚从安省一个考古现场过来，等休息两天，就又要回去了，这次发现的古董数量，价值总和，恐怕已经一个多亿了”，张澈颇为得意地道。见到于梅梅一脸吃惊的样子，柳景岚微笑道：“妈，你激动什么，古董是国家的，又不是挖出来让我们去卖钱的。”“妈当然知道了，但没钱投进去，哪能让你们去考古啊”，于梅梅又问道：“张澈，你们家做什么的？刚才你开来的那辆大车子，是你的吗？你读博士还没毕业就这么有钱啊？”张澈一脸随意地笑道：“伯母，这是我爸妈为了让我考古方便买给我的车，也就两百多万，不算什么。”“哎哟……两百多万？都够市里买套一百多平的房子了！”于梅梅咽了咽喉咙，笑得眼都眯起来了，“你家里做什么的呀？”“我爸是文物局副局长，正厅级，我妈是咱京城大学的考古系教授，也是因为我爸妈都从事着方面工作，我才选了考古系”。张澈一脸爱慕地看向一旁的柳景岚，“也庆幸我选了考古系，能让我遇见景岚。”柳景岚似乎对这样的表白无动于衷，只是淡淡地笑了笑。“你……你们是在处对象？”于梅梅眼前一亮。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/nuzongcaideshenjibaobiao/9.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 0009 After Liu Jinglan took a cold shower, she changed into clean white short-sleeved shirts and khaki cropped pants, and wearing a pair of black plastic flip-flops, Lin Fei walked out of the apartment again. He almost always takes some time to go to the streets to see if any shops are recruiting employees, but now there are so many migrant workers. As a young man, he is always considered to be unable to endure hardships, and other aunties always get there first. As the morning passed, Lin Fei pawned the silver necklace for more than a thousand yuan to relieve his financial stress. By the way, I bought a few spicy dried vegetable pancakes from a roadside stall, ate them for lunch, and then continued walking around construction sites, looking for work. But nowadays, most construction sites are becoming more and more specialized and controlled by construction companies and large contractors. It is also difficult for him to find a profitable job, and he always fails. In the evening, Lin Fei remembered that Liu Hongbin invited him to dinner. He quickly returned to the rental house, changed into clean clothes, and hurried to Liu Hongbin's house. Liu Hongbin had already been waiting at home early and called to remind him. Arriving at Liu Hongbin's house, the door was already open. Lin Fei discovered that in addition to Lao Liu's taxi, there was also a black Range Rover parked at the door. Could it be that his daughter Liu Jinglan drove this two-million-dollar car? As soon as he entered the yard, he saw Liu Hongbin killing crucian carp by the faucet. \"Lin Fei, you're here. Hey, your sister-in-law is going to make your favorite pickled crucian carp. Let me kill a few more.\" Liu Hongbin had been a soldier before and had a cheerful temperament. He was in his forties and still had a strong figure, but his slender face was full of the vicissitudes of time, and his hair was a little white. \"You don't need so much, it's almost enough. My sister-in-law has just been discharged from the hospital. We can't make her too tired,\" Lin Fei said with a smile. \"How can this be so? I, Lao Liu, don't like to owe anyone else, not even friends. During this time, you have been helping me work late at night, and you have also looked for jobs and worked on construction sites during the day. Do you think I don't know? I should reward you well,\" Liu Hongbin said stubbornly. Lin Fei liked this old man's sincerity. The older generation had endured hardships and served as soldiers, so their mental outlook was different. \"Hurry in, that girl Jing Lan has just come back, and she brought a classmate of his, her name is...what's her name, I forgot, hey, anyway, you and Jing Lan can talk more.\" Liu Hongbin winked at Lin Fei with an expression that said \"every man understands\". Lin Fei smiled, it seemed that this guy was worried about his daughter's marriage until his hair turned gray, and he really wanted to find an in-law for his daughter right away. Entering the living room, I saw a man and a woman already watching TV, and my sister-in-law Yu Meimei was holding the woman's hand, saying something with a smile, and looking at the man next to her from time to time. \"Lin Fei, are you here?\" Yu Meimei, who was a little fat and mature, saw Lin Fei and said hello: \"Come on, sit down, I will pour you some herbal tea and let you get to know each other. This is what I told Lao Liu Chang. Our daughter Liu Jinglan, this is her PhD student in the university. My name is Zhang Che.\" Lin Fei smiled and nodded to the two of them. Liu Jinglan smiled politely, while Zhang Che looked at Lin Fei's clothes up and down. There was a hint of disdain and arrogance in his eyes, but it was fleeting. Instead, he stood up and shook hands with Lin Fei in a friendly manner. \"Hello, my name is Zhang Che, and I am Jing Lan's senior.\" He was wearing a Givenchy printed white short-sleeved shirt, his hair was neatly combed, his face was fair and fair, and he was about 1.8 meters tall. He looked like a male model from a wealthy family. \"My name is Lin Fei.\" Lin Fei knew that this guy looked down on him, but it didn't matter. Anyway, today was just a courtesy to Lao Liu and his wife, so they came to have a meal. Liu Jinglan said in a soft voice: \"I heard from mom that in the past two or three months, you have been helping my dad work late night rentals and helped my mom pay a lot of medical expenses. I really want to thank you.\" The woman was wearing a loose white straight-striped shirt, and she could faintly see the proud curves inside, as well as a purple bra, and a pair of light brown hip-covering cropped pants underneath. Her tight and slender legs looked very delicate. She has a fair complexion, a pointed chin, and a delicate nose. She wears a pair of thin black-rimmed glasses. It can be seen from her beautiful big eyes that the prescription of the glasses is not high, or they are simply decorations. Her long black hair hangs simply on the side of her right shoulder, and she exudes a quiet and bookish temperament, as well as a hint of fresh charm. Lin Fei had always heard Lao Liu praising his daughter as a beauty before, but Lin Fei didn't quite believe it, but today he saw that she was indeed a beauty, and she was the kind that became more and more attractive the more she looked at her. Lin Fei shook his head, \"I also get a share. It's much easier than going to the construction site to make money.\" \"Oh? Xiao Lin also goes to work at the construction site? I wonder what kind of skills he knows?\" Zhang Che asked with a slanted corner of his mouth. Lin Fei said calmly: \"I mostly carry bags, carry some things, and occasionally work as a cement worker when I have the opportunity. But it's hard to find work recently, so it's a bit of a headache.\" \"Jing Lan and I also often work at construction sites, but we are at the 'archaeological construction site.' Haha, your work is different from Xiaolin. We require meticulousness and professionalism. After all, many of those antiques are priceless.\" Zhang Che called \"Xiao Lin\" very naturally, as if he didn't bother to call Lin Fei's full name. Yu Meimei asked expectantly at this time: \"Zhang Che, Jing Lan didn't tell us what she was doing outside. So you really went to dig for antiques? I heard that those antiques cost tens of millions!\" \"Yes, Auntie, actually this time I just came from an archaeological site in Ontario with Jing Lan. After two days of rest, we will go back again. The number and total value of the antiques found this time is probably more than 1 billion,\" Zhang Che said proudly. Seeing Yu Meimei's surprised look, Liu Jinglan smiled and said: \"Mom, why are you excited? Antiques belong to the country, and they are not dug up for us to sell for money.\" \"Of course Mom knows, but if you don't have money to invest, how can you let you go to archeology?\"", "title_en": "Chapter 9"}